      "input_sha256": "6d6041e31b1ba672b2cfd085a468cf47447709dd726cc9ad3d07a3c1b419e318",
      "input_utf8_bytes": 115,
      "rendered_text": "At the unrelated Tern charity, Omar coordinates museum volunteers. This is not the business incident-response rota.\n",
